      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "",
        "\nA captivating, extremely detailed, professional shot of a european woman with olive skin complex, a gorgeous sexy body and a intricate hairstyle, exploring a horror scene filled with suspense and dread. The style should be impressionalistic, with soft brushstrokes and a focus on capturing the emotional atmosphere of the terrifying location. The woman is portrayed with a mix of fear and determination as she navigates the frightening environment, her expression conveying a sense of both vulnerability and resolve. The setting is meticulously crafted, with attention to detail in every corner, from the decaying architecture to the ominous shadows that dance along the walls. The overall composition is designed to draw the viewer into the scene, immersing them in the woman's harrowing journey through the depths of the horror scene, making them feel every emotion, every heartbeat, and every breath. The color palette is carefully chosen to enhance the sense of unease and foreboding, with dark tones and subtle highlights that create a chilling and unforgettable visual experience. The artist has skillfully combined elements of realism and impressionism to create a truly unique and compelling work of art.\n"
      ],
      "color": "#2a363b",
      "bgcolor": "#3f5159",
      "shape": 1
