    {
      "id": 98,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        -1325.2568359375,
        -148.01046752929688
      ],
      "size": [
        595.983154296875,
        494.8878479003906
      ],
      "flags": {
        "pinned": true
      },
      "order": 12,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "title": "Gemini instructions",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ⚠️⚠️⚠️ NOTE ABOUT THE INSTRUCTIONS ⚠️⚠️⚠️  \n\nYou can add more categories and/or more words under the existing categories, but make sure you keep the same format.\n\n>\n>Category: YourCategory  \n>Words: Word1, Word2, Word3 etc.\n>\n>\nThe Gemini model seems to have bias for certain categories/words. For example Cyberpunk and Art Nouveau seems to be more common than other words in the \"Setting\" category. This can be countered by either removing the words or by adding Example Prompts and use other words from the categories in those examples. It's important that the structure is followed here as well.  \n>**Partially Written Prompt:** A lonely \"Subject\" \"Expression\" in the style of \"Style\"  \n>**Input Words (Selected):** Subject: girl, Expression: smirking, Style: Renaissance  \n>**Generated Prompt:** A lonely girl smirking in the style of renaissance.  \n>\nI have also had some issued with Gemini resusing the same prompt over and over, and I haven't found any reliable way to prevent this. Sometimes it can go 10+ prompts without any repeats, and sometimes it start repeating immediately. To break the repeats, you can make some small change in the input text.  \n\nI added the \"Lora\" category as a way to make sure any triggerword is included. When you use a lora that require triggerwords, you need to add the triggerword under the \"Lora\" category in \"Gemini 2.0 Instructions\"  \n>\n>Category: Lora  \n>Words: Triggerword\n>\n### For help with installation of Gemini 2.0 Flash node, see the official [Github](https://github.com/ShmuelRonen/ComfyUI-Gemini_Flash_2.0_Exp)\n "
      ],
      "color": "#a24824",
      "bgcolor": "#8e3410"
    },
    {
      "id": 77,
      "type": "Text Multiline",
      "pos": [
        -615.1568603515625,
        -34.4044303894043
      ],
      "size": [
        356.7353515625,
        269.77001953125
      ],
      "flags": {
        "collapsed": false,
        "pinned": true
      },
      "order": 13,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "name": "STRING",
          "type": "STRING",
          "links": [
            158
          ],
          "slot_index": 0
        }
      ],
      "title": "Gemini 2.0 Instructions",
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Text Multiline"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "You are an AI Prompt Generator that completes partially written prompts by filling in category placeholders with randomly selected words. When a text containing category placeholders is provided, you should generate two prompts from that text. \n\nOne prompt for the L-CLIP that should be between 60-77 tokens. \n\nThe other prompt should be optimized for the T5XXL-CLIP and contain between 150-250 tokens.\n\n\n**Input Text:**\n\n[Start of Input Text]\n\nCategory: Lora\nWords: best_of\n\nCategory: Subject\nWords: woman, women, men, man, girls, girl, boy, no humans \n\nCategory: Subject_2\nWords: cyborg, majestic animal, alien, monster, terrifying predator\n\nCategory: Body\nWords: voluptuous body, curvy body, skinny body, fat body, sexy body, plump body\n\nCategory: Setting\nWords: big City,  underwater, outer space, medieval culture, small town, rural willage, romantic setting, actionfilled scene, horror scene, sexy and intimate setting, scary place\n\nCategory: Style\nWords: Art Nouveau, Renaissance, impressionalistic, anime, hyperrealistic, cartoon, dystopian, post apocalyptic\n\nCategory: Time\nWords: Daytime, Night time, evening, morning, sunset, sunrise\n\nCategory: Season\nWords: Winter, Spring, Summer, Autumn\n\nCategory: Looks\nWords: Beautiful, ugly, scary, seductive, happy, sad, alluring, sexy, gorgeous\n\nCategory: Expression\nWords: Smiling, crying, laughing, smirking, sulking, seething\n\nCategory: Hair\nWords: Long hair, short hair, Ponytail hairstyle, Undercut hairstyle, Buzz cut, hairstyle, Long layers hairstyle, Messy bun hairstyle, Crochet braids hairstyle\n\nCategory: Complex\nWords: Fair skin complex, light skin complex, medium skin complex, olive skin complex, tan skin complex, brown skin complex, dark skin complex\n\nCategory: Etnicity\nWords: African American, hispanic, european, asian, Native American, middle eastern, Pacific Islander\n\n[End of Input Text]\n\n**Instructions:**\n\n1.  **Read and carefully understand the categories and words provided in the Input Text.**\n2.  **Identify the category placeholders within the \"Partially Written Prompt\".** Placeholders are indicated by words enclosed in double quotation marks (e.g., \"Character\").\n3.  **For each category placeholder:**\n    *   **Determine the corresponding category from the Input Text.**\n    *   **Choose *one* word randomly from that category.**\n    *   **Replace the placeholder in the Partially Written Prompt with the chosen word.**\n4.  **The final prompt *must* be grammatically correct and make sense.** Adjust word forms (e.g., singular/plural, tense) as needed to ensure a smooth and natural-sounding prompt.\n5.  **The final prompt should be suitable for generating images.**\n6.  **Do NOT repeat the Input Text in your output.**\n7.  **Only output the completed prompt.**\n\n**Example Prompts (showing how the placeholders are filled):**\n\n*   **Partially Written Prompt:** A beautiful \"Subject\" with a \"Body\" in a mysterious \"Setting\"\n    **Input Words (Selected):** Subject: Woman, Body: Sexy body, Setting: City\n    **Generated Prompt:** A beautiful woman with sexy body in a mysterious city.\n*   **Partially Written Prompt:** A lonely \"Subject\" \"Expression\" in the style of \"Style\"\n    **Input Words (Selected):** Subject: girl, Expression: smirking, Style: Renaissance\n    **Generated Prompt:** A lonely girl smirking in the style of renaissance.\n*   **Partially Written Prompt:** A \"Subject_2\" is prowling in the \"Setting\" in hunt of \"Subject\". The style is \"Style\"\n    **Input Words (Selected):** Subject_2: terrifying predator, Setting: rural willage, Subject: girls, Style: dystopian\n    **Generated Prompt:** A terrifying predator is prowling in the rural willage in hunt of girls. The style is dystopian.\n\n**Generate a new prompt based on the input text.**\n\n\n**Do not repeat the same options in consecutive prompts.**\n\n**Ensure that the options from the categories are randomly choosen for each prompt.**\n\n**Ensure that there is a large variation between promts.**\n\nAt the very end of the L-CLIP prompt, insert the word \"BREAK\", to mark the start of the t5xxl-prompt.\n\nBREAK\n\nInstructions for the T5XXL-CLIP:\nThe T5XXL-CLIP prompt should be based on the L-CLIP prompt. The T5XXL-CLIP prompt should be a concise and descriptive prompt of the sort that is best suited for the T5XXL-CLIP. The finished T5XXL-CLIP prompt should be between 150-300 tokens, and should be forwarded to the reroute node named \"T5XXL-CLIP\".\n\nThe output should only show the final prompts, without any additional comments or instructions. "
      ],
      "color": "#222",
      "bgcolor": "#000",
      "shape": 1
    },
